      "status": "withdrawn_not_actionable",
      "reviewer_reference": "Root supplied-form challenge and independent B source re-review,2026-11-08; source molecules are not sufficient proof of historical supplied reagent.",
      "withdrawal_reason": "MediaDB compound35 identifies its GDP database entity as CHEBI17552/KEGGC00035, but that normalized biochemical identity does not establish the ingredient actually supplied in MediaDB85 PJC with glucose. The frozen full-recipe reference already flags the glucose-title/GDP-component contradiction. Original Sanchez1989 PMID2647149 abstract confirms publication identity but contains no complete PJC formulation; current publisher article/PDF requests returned403, and bounded exact-title/DOI searches did not retrieve original formulation bytes. GDP versus glucose therefore remains unresolved, and even a confirmed GDP component would require supplied counterion/hydrate information before an exact reagent mapping. The earlier neutral-GDP draft is withdrawn and preserved in the review archive; raw GDP, original occurrence and all holds remain unchanged."
    },
